{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06578","headline":"昭圣观 · 储光羲","name":"昭圣观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主家隐溪口，微路入花源。\n数日朝青阁，彩云犹在门。\n双楼夹一殿，玉女侍玄元。\n扶橑尽蟠木，步櫩多画繙。\n新松引天籁，小柏绕山樊。\n坐弄竹阴远，行随溪水喧。\n石池辨春色，林兽知人言。\n未逐凤皇去，真宫在此原。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}